To run the project, you may run the "pnpm run dev" at the root of the project.
The root should display something like :"edouardbelair@Edouards-MBP-2 Project0 %"


This is for the dockerized backend, it will be used for the ECS deployment
To build the backend:
docker build -f backend/Dockerfile -t nest-backend .
To run the backend:
docker run -p 3001:3001 nest-backend

